    "Learns the coarse places you eat (on-device) and skips nudges elsewhere. Needs a few meals to learn first — %@ place(s) learned. Never gates until then." : {

    },
    "Lets a paired **Mac** or **parent iPhone** connect over Bluetooth to view status and (with permission) deliver boluses — even when this phone is locked. Each device's permissions (view-only vs. control) are set when you pair it and editable under **Pair a remote → the device**. Pairing is authenticated and end-to-end encrypted, **but turning this on makes the phone advertise a connectable Bluetooth service, a small added attack surface. Leave it off unless you use a remote.** (Your Apple Watch and Garmin are unaffected.)" : {

