    },
    "Reorder the Garmin app's swipe screens, and choose how the watch-face BG complication looks. Applied on the watch's next update. ⚠️ If the complication doesn't show correctly, switch the display mode — the color path uses a complication field that's unverified on-device (see docs/UNVERIFIED-GUESSES.md)." : {

