    "Safety" : {

    },
    "Saves everything faBolus keeps on this device — your glucose, insulin and carb history, the settings change log, and the bolus delivery audit trail — as a single **`.json`** file you can save to Files or iCloud Drive. It never leaves the device except to the file you choose; faBolus has no servers." : {

